## 4. SPACING & LAYOUT

**8-point grid. Everything is a multiple of 8 (or 4 for fine adjustments):**
```
4px  — micro gap (icon-to-label, tight pairs)
8px  — small gap (within a component)
12px — medium-small (field internal padding)
16px — base unit (standard gap, card padding minimum)
24px — medium (between related components)
32px — large (between sections within a screen)
40px — xl (between major screen sections)
48px — 2xl (screen-level top/bottom padding)
```

**Screen padding (horizontal):** 20px on both sides. Consistent everywhere.

**Card border-radius:**
```
Cards/sheets:    16px
Buttons:         12px
Input fields:    10px
Tags/chips:      20px (fully rounded)
Alert banners:   12px
Bottom sheets:   24px top corners only
```

**Shadow system (teal-tinted, never neutral grey):**
```
card-shadow:    0 2px 12px rgba(13,74,92,0.08)
button-shadow:  0 4px 16px rgba(13,74,92,0.16)
modal-shadow:   0 8px 32px rgba(13,74,92,0.20)
```

