## 10. ACCESSIBILITY

Not optional. Build it from day one.

```
Minimum tap target:   44×44px (everything interactive)
Colour contrast:      4.5:1 minimum for body text (WCAG AA)
                      3:1 for large text (18sp+ / 14sp+ bold)
Focus indicators:     visible ring for keyboard/switch navigation
                      2px teal outline, 2px offset
Screen reader:        accessibilityLabel on every interactive element
                      accessibilityHint on anything that isn't self-explanatory
                      accessibilityRole where relevant
Dynamic text:         layouts must not break at 1.5× text size (iOS/Android
                      accessibility text scale)
Reduced motion:       check useReducedMotion, cut transitions if true
```

Colour combinations that are confirmed accessible in this palette:
- Deep teal text on cream bg: ✅ 8.5:1
- White text on deep teal: ✅ 8.5:1
- Slate text on white: ✅ 5.9:1
- Coral on white (error text): ✅ 4.6:1

